  "cheatNotes": [
    "_` Random Select",
    "- On the Character Select Screen ^8 and press _S",
    "_` 2nd, 3rd, 4th and 5th Color",
    "- On the Character Select Screen, press _2 / _8",
    "_` Stage and Music Select",
    "- On the Character Select Screen press:",
    "- Snow Shrine                    ^8_+_O^E",
    "- Scrolling Dungeon              ^8_+_O^F",
    "- Ice Sculpture                  ^8_+_O^G",
    "- Castle Rooftop                 ^8_+_O^H",
    "- Chicago Rooftop                ^8_+_O^I",
    "- Desert Rooftop                 ^8_+_O^J",
    "- Canyon Bridge                  ^2_+_O^E",
    "- Bloody Altar                   ^2_+_O^F",
    "- Lava Bridge                    ^2_+_O^G",
    "- Chicago Street                 ^2_+_O^H",
    "- Castle Fireplace               ^2_+_O^I",
    "- Sky Platform                   ^2_+_O^I on both sides",
    "- Ultratech Industries           ^2_+_O^J",
    "- The 1st player who done the code will select the Stage",
    "- The 2nd player who done the code will select the Music",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` Easy Combo Breaker Mode",
    "- On the vs. Screen ^2_+_O_S on both sides",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` High Scores Table",
    "- During the Attractive Mode press _8"
